                                                                                                            </div>
                                                                                        <div class="card-heading-wrapper">
                                    <h5 class="card-heading">Global economic pressure points call for policy discipline</h5>
                                                                    </div>
                            
                                                            <div class="card-description"><p>Pablo Hernández de Cos says economic pressure points pose risks to global growth stemming from vulnerabilities in the financial system, strained public finances and major supply shocks which are still playing out.</p></div>
                            
                                                            <div class="card-author">
                                    <span class="card-author__prefix">By</span>
